   HDF4 / HDF5 \tab \code{.hdf}, \code{.h4}, \code{.he4}, \code{.h5}, \code{.hdf5}, \code{.he5} \tab raster \tab MODIS, VIIRS, GEDI; pick subdatasets with \code{var} \cr
